Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Cara,

Yes, I think the function you're looking for is postHocLM() <https://doserlab.com/files/spoccupancy-web/reference/posthoclm>. You can provide the full posterior of any estimated value as the response variable in that model and then fit some sort of linear regression model, allowing for full uncertainty propagation.

Kind regards,

Jeff

